\"date\":\"2026-05-21T15:51:43+03:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Restore lg height for Search component (#1778)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"The bundled Carbon emits the layout-token clamp on .cds--search-input\\nbut does not bridge the cds--search--lg size class to\\n--cds-layout-size-height, so <Search size=\\\"lg\\\"> falls back to md (40px)\\nand renders shorter than a paired lg Button across O3. Set the token\\non .cds--search--lg in the styleguide so the clamp resolves to lg\\n(48px) until @carbon/styles is bumped to a version that wires this\\nup natively.\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"89487272bee51407cf8bf89ec897e8c42ff91c78\",\"date\":\"2026-05-20T13:46:34+03:00\",\"message\":\"fix date range separator alignment\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"denniskigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e1470604dafd40c0e687b75b8838278061c511db\",\"date\":\"2026-05-12T04:26:08+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5651: Update the procedure order icon (#1773)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Dilan Kavishka\",\"authorEmail\":\"109354298+dilankavishka@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"2ee754fabbb5c2c7beaa2123590cac44e0d27b1e\",\"date\":\"2026-05-07T13:45:35-04:00\",\"message\":\"(feat) Add matchLocale framework function (#1771)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"f1c28bc93332623961245b26da6347cef223131c\",\"date\":\"2026-05-06T14:18:36-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Add a semi-automated documentation workflow (#1770)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e16e2d9e16a891670bbf4dd0a79ebe81414405d8\",\"date\":\"2026-05-01T18:32:38+05:30\",\"message\":\"(test) Add regression tests for 401 Location-header redirect in openmrsFetch (#1754)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ash\",\"authorEmail\"