{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016VQfctBS1SqEJ1ZajSRRwu","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"744dd2abdf636d1fc4b3b6b163220e6995378022\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05T18:55:54-04:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Framework and E2E test fixes (#1934)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Framework and E2E test fixes\\n\\n* The logout spec now gets a session of its own so it doesn't race the\\n  shared auth store.\\n* O3-5982: `getTranslationOverrides()` always settles whereas previously\\n  it could hang indefinitely.\\n* O3-5975: `useConfig()` now uses only a single suspense promise per\\n  config id and drops it when it settles, so re-renders of the same\\n  component wait on the same promise. This promise now doesn't settle\\n  until the config does.\\n* Several scripts _here only_ depend on '^build' of the framework. This\\n  is correctly reflected in the turbo setup. This only applies to esm-core.\\n* The E2E scripts don't strictly depend on `docker`\\n\\n* Simplify comment\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"}],\"totalCount\":1}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d685a47f-9966-4c81-87b3-9a6b74404495","uuid":"645710ca-d61c-4c5d-9074-3fbaa74fca25","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:13:39.945Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"744dd2abdf636d1fc4b3b6b163220e6995378022\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05T18:55:54-04:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Framework and E2E test fixes (#1934)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Framework and E2E test fixes\\n\\n* The logout spec now gets a session of its own so it doesn't race the\\n  shared auth store.\\n* O3-5982: `getTranslationOverrides()` always settles whereas previously\\n  it could hang indefinitely.\\n* O3-5975: `useConfig()` now uses only a single suspense promise per\\n  config id and drops it when it settles, so re-renders of the same\\n  component wait on the same promise. This pr