Add a changeset gentle-jars-pull.md\\n\\n* (chore) Add docs\\n\\n* Clean-up README and _main-content.scss\\n\\n* Fixup changesets\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"9042cb6c5010ab2316aeec2dc295bf4c410a66de\",\"date\":\"2026-09-02T14:46:10-04:00\",\"message\":\"(BREAKING) Extension system should not re-derive in full on every write (#1856)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"This PR overhauls the extension system's internal recomputation model to eliminate O(n²) behavior where any single write triggered a full re-derivation of state for every module, extension, and slot in the app.\\n\\nBreakages:\\n\\n* assignedExtensions in the extension store are renamed candidateExtensions to reflect their role. Use getAssignedExtensions() or useAssignedExtensions() to get the correct list.\\n* useAssignedExtensionIds() is now implemented in terms of useAssignedExtensions() and has been deprecated.\\n* useStore() no longer returns a copy of the store's state, but the state directly.\\n* Parcels will hard fail if they do not render within 15 seconds of loading.\\n* Extensions added through configuration now retain the order they are defined in configuration.\\n* Extension rendering state is no longer tracked in the extension store.\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"}],\"totalCount\":3}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d685a47f-9966-4c81-87b3-9a6b74404495","uuid":"07a5ff9f-c3c4-44fe-aca3-eff6f94465f0","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:13:41.585Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"c1bfbcbb06105e7ffd9b4a69556722469ac13c44\",\"date\":\"2026-09-30T18:54:21-04:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Minimize churn from config updates when there are many extensions (#1922)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Minimize churn from config updates when there are many extensions\\n\\nWhen an extension mounts, we update the extension config store. This can\\nforce us to recompute configurations even where nothing has changed,\\nleading to some unnecessary render churn. This adds memoization so we\\nonly recompute an extensions config if we actually need to.\\n\\nSimilarly, when sorting extensions in a slot we were unnecessarily\\ncalculating the order using a O(n^2) algorithm. This is now swapped for\\nan O(n) version at the cost of two passes through the list of extension\\nids.\\n\\n* Create changeset\\n\\n* Address greptile's comments\\n\\n* (chore) Add docs\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a62f8164991a64135f438cef848fdc751e866d20\",\"date\":\"2026-09-28T14:08:46-04:00\",\"message\":\"(BREAKING) Remove offline & rxjs support from framework (#1894)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (BREAKING) Remove offline & rxjs support from framework\\n\\nRetains a small compatibility shim with the most commonly-used public\\nfunctions now stubbed. These deprecated shims will be removed in a\\nfuture version.\\n\\nThe biggest breaking change is the framework no longer supports rxjs\\ndirectly. Functions that returned Observables now return Promises. A\\nsmall compatibility patch is provided for the notifications system.\\n\\n* Fix `getCurrentUser`'s opts\\n\\n* Remove isLoginEnabled\\n\\n* Sounder re-implementation of getCurrentUser()\\n\\n* Remove more stuff, add back a couple of drop APIs we need, and re-add mocks\\n\\n* More clean-up\\n\\n* Add a changeset gentle-jars-pull.md\\n\\n* (chore) Add docs\\n\\n* Clean-up README and _main-content.scss\\n\\n* Fixup changesets\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"9042cb6c5010ab2316aeec2dc295bf4c410a66de\",\"date\":\"2026-09-02T14:46:10-04:00\",\"message\":\"(BREAKING) Extension system should not re-derive in full on every write (#1856)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"This PR overhauls the extension system's internal recomputation model to eliminate O(n²) behavior where any single write triggered a full re-derivation of state for every module, extension, and slot in the app.\\n\\nBreakages:\\n\\n* assignedExtensions in the extension store are renamed candidateExtensions to reflect their role. Use getAssignedExtensions() or useAssignedExtensions() to get the correct list.\\n* useAssignedExtensionIds() is now implemented in terms of useAssignedExtensions() and has been deprecated.\\n* useStore() no longer returns a copy of the store's state, but the state directly.\\n* Parcels will hard fail if they do not render within 15 seconds of loading.\\n* Extensions added through configuration now retain the order they are defined in configuration.\\n* Extension rendering state is no longer tracked in the extension store.\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"}],\"totalCount\":3}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FyKTtRLnnCRbTSa5aXDL98","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
